7,(PDF) OS YAWANAWÁ DO RIO GREGÓRIO: TRANSFORMAÇÕES E MUSICALIDADE,https://www.academia.edu/83920995/OS_YAWANAWÁ_DO_RIO_GREGÓRIO_TRANSFORMAÇÕES_E_MUSICALIDADE,"January 1, 2021 - BORTOLI, Cristiane. Tradições orais e canções Shanenawa através das memórias de Shuayne, patriarca da aldeia Shane Kaya.",Shanenawa,Panoan
8,Shanenawa Caiçuma Festival & More,https://orisha-ossain.com/the-shanenawa/,"Fearing that they might lose their rights to the land, given the history of violence and injustice they had suffered, the Shanenawa chose not to correct the misunderstanding. Linguistic studies conducted in the 1990s confirmed this situation, as the Shanenawa language belongs to the Panoan family, not the Katukina family.",Shanenawa,Panoan
9,[Digital] Songs & Healing with the Shanenawa,https://digital.aniwa.co/courses/songs-healing-with-the-shanenawa,"The Shane Awihuhu Rayai including Kene Mani Maya, Vaná, Nawashahu, Runi, Awakuruany, and Paje Runi Shanenawa of the village of Morada Nova in Acre, Brazil shared their songs and prayers during this digital healing.",Shanenawa,Panoan
